OHOS: make text translation usable and restore automatic scrolling. The
OHOS package did not define the free-translation endpoint, so the built-in
"Free translation" model had an empty base URL. Provide the same public
endpoints as the desktop presets. For scrolling screenshots, inject the
wheel step through OH_Input_InjectMouseEventGlobal and request the
user-authorized injection permission on the first step.

